event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":92,"item_id":"rs_0117c821ec4dcee5016aca795fc1188197a1fa200e6bb5a535","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test setup**\n\nI need to create a concise test lifecycle using a server that listens on a random port. I think it’s best to spawn a fixed pick with a net port reserve and have the race be negligible. I’ll set the startup log to not use the chosen port, and maybe I should randomize it for readiness around 18000. \n\nAlright, I’m thinking I’ll have the node test spawn at a random port—that should help with flexibility!"}

